OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 87, who died after being hit 
OL,4,Aby car was a 'much-loved grandfather'  
OL,6,FAn 87-year-old man who died after being
OL,7,Fstruck by a car in Larbert has been    
OL,8,Fnamed as Douglas Agnew.                
OL,10,FThe pensioner was hit by a black Mazda 
OL,11,F6 on the A88 Bellsdyke Road, near the  
OL,12,Fjunction with McCartney Road, at about 
OL,13,F17:30 on 20 November.                  
OL,15,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene a  
OL,16,Fshort time later.                      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
